 "how_to_read": "workflow health: ok / warn / degraded / failed / unknown. 'success' conclusions are judged from log text, not trusted. Postponed games and schedule_health: ok / missed per workflow (last SCHEDULED run vs tolerated gap; manual runs do not count). same-day games can appear in the ledger_health lists; they are leads, not verdicts."
}
